OL,3,AWorld Cup drove profits surge, says    
OL,4,AMarston's                              
OL,6,FPub company Marston's has said an      
OL,7,F"excellent World Cup" helped drive     
OL,8,Fstronger trading as annual profits rose
OL,9,Fby nearly a fifth, despite reporting a 
OL,10,Fdip in sales.                          
OL,12,FThe Wolverhampton-based firm, which    
OL,13,Foperates more than 1,300 pubs across   
OL,14,Fthe UK, reported underlying pre-tax    
OL,15,Fprofits of #85.4m for the year to 26   
OL,16,FSeptember, up 18.4% from a year        
OL,17,Fearlier.                               
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
