OL,3,AWorld Cup drove profits surge, says    
OL,4,AMarston's                              
OL,6,FThe company said trading was improved  
OL,7,Fby new-look pubs, strong trade during  
OL,8,Fthis summer's football World Cup, and a
OL,9,Fpartnership with Jeremy Clarkson's     
OL,10,FHawkstone drinks brand.                
OL,12,F"For the third year running, profit is 
OL,13,Fsignificantly up, cash flow is strong  
OL,14,Fand margins have improved," said chief 
OL,15,Fexecutive Justin Platt.                
